 SecretKey key()throws Exception{KeyStore ks=KeyStore.getInstance("AndroidKeyStore");ks.load(null);if(!ks.containsAlias("github")){KeyGenerator g=KeyGenerator.getInstance("AES","AndroidKeyStore");g.init(new KeyGenParameterSpec.Builder("github",KeyProperties.PURPOSE_ENCRYPT|KeyProperties.PURPOSE_DECRYPT).setBlockModes(KeyProperties.BLOCK_MODE_GCM).setEncryptionPaddings(KeyProperties.ENCRYPTION_PADDING_NONE).build());g.generateKey();}return (SecretKey)ks.getKey("github",null);}
 void saveToken(String token)throws Exception{if(token.isEmpty()){prefs().edit().remove("secret").remove("iv").apply();return;}Cipher c=Cipher.getInstance("AES/GCM/NoPadding");c.init(Cipher.ENCRYPT_MODE,key());prefs().edit().putString("secret",android.util.Base64.encodeToString(c.doFinal(token.getBytes("UTF-8")),2)).putString("iv",android.util.Base64.encodeToString(c.getIV(),2)).apply();}
 String token()throws Exception{String s=prefs().getString("secret","");if(s.isEmpty())return "";Cipher c=Cipher.getInstance("AES/GCM/NoPadding");c.init(Cipher.DECRYPT_MODE,key(),new GCMParameterSpec(128,android.util.Base64.decode(prefs().getString("iv",""),2)));return new String(c.doFinal(android.util.Base64.decode(s,2)),"UTF-8");}
 void settings(){LinearLayout box=column();box.setPadding(dp(22),dp(8),dp(22),dp(8));box.addView(label("Для приватных проектов нужен GitHub Personal Access Token. Создай fine-grained token для своих репозиториев: Metadata — Read-only, Pages — Read-only. Выбери все нужные репозитории.\nТокен хранится зашифрованным только на телефоне и отправляется только api.github.com.",14,white));Button help=button("Создать токен в GitHub ↗");help.setOnClickListener(v->open("https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new"));box.addView(help);EditText input=new EditText(this);input.setTextColor(white);input.setHintTextColor(muted);input.setHint("Вставь токен GitHub");input.setSingleLine();input.setInputType(129);box.addView(input);AlertDialog d=new AlertDialog.Builder(this).setTitle("Подключение GitHub").setView(box).setPositiveButton("Сохранить",null).setNeutralButton("Отключить",(a,b)->{try{saveToken("");prefs().edit().remove("repos").apply();repos=new JSONArray();render();sync();}catch(Exception e){status.setText("Не удалось удалить подключение");}}).setNegativeButton("Отмена",null).create();d.setOnShowListener(v->d.getButton(-1).setOnClickListener(w->{String t=input.getText().toString().trim();if(t.isEmpty()){input.setError("Вставь токен или нажми «Отключить»");return;}try{saveToken(t);d.dismiss();sync();}catch(Exception e){input.setError("Не удалось сохранить токен");}}));d.show();}
 String request(String path,String t)throws Exception{HttpURLConnection c=(HttpURLConnection)new URL("https://api.github.com"+path).openConnection();c.setInstanceFollowRedirects(false);c.setConnectTimeout(15000);c.setReadTimeout(20000);c.setRequestProperty("Accept","application/vnd.github+json");c.setRequestProperty("X-GitHub-Api-Version","2022-11-28");c.setRequestProperty("User-Agent","Nicolenkoe-Project-Hub/1.0");if(!t.isEmpty())c.setRequestProperty("Authorization","Bearer "+t);try{int code=c.getResponseCode();if(code!=200)throw new IOException("HTTP "+code);try(InputStream in=c.getInputStream();ByteArrayOutputStream out=new ByteArrayOutputStream()){byte[] b=new byte[8192];int n;while((n=in.read(b))!=-1)out.write(b,0,n);return out.toString("UTF-8");}}finally{c.disconnect();}}
 void sync(){if(busy)return;busy=true;refresh.setEnabled(false);status.setText("Обновляю репозитории и сайты…");executor.execute(()->{try{String t=token();JSONArray result=new JSONArray();for(int page=1;;page++){String endpoint=t.isEmpty()?"/users/nicolenkoe/repos?per_page=100&page=":"/user/repos?affiliation=owner&per_page=100&page=";JSONArray batch=new JSONArray(request(endpoint+page,t));for(int i=0;i<batch.length();i++){JSONObject r=batch.getJSONObject(i);if(!r.getJSONObject("owner").optString("login").equalsIgnoreCase("nicolenkoe"))continue;JSONObject p=new JSONObject();p.put("name",r.getString("name"));p.put("private",r.optBoolean("private"));p.put("html_url",r.getString("html_url"));String site="";if(r.optBoolean("has_pages")){String full=r.getString("full_name");try{site=new JSONObject(request("/repos/"+full+"/pages",t)).optString("html_url");}catch(Exception e){}if(site.isEmpty())site="https://nicolenkoe.github.io/"+(r.getString("name").equalsIgnoreCase("nicolenkoe.github.io")?"":Uri.encode(r.getString("name"))+"/");}p.put("site",site);result.put(p);}if(batch.length()<100)break;}JSONObject self=new JSONObject();self.put("name","my-projects");self.put("private",false);self.put("html_url","https://github.com/nicolenkoe/fragment-logo-editor/tree/gh-pages/my-projects");self.put("site","https://nicolenkoe.github.io/fragment-logo-editor/my-projects/");result.put(self);String stamp=java.text.DateFormat.getDateTimeInstance(3,3).format(new java.util.Date());prefs().edit().putString("repos",result.toString()).putString("updated",stamp).apply();runOnUiThread(()->{repos=result;render();status.setText("Обновлено: "+stamp+" · "+result.length()+" проектов"+(t.isEmpty()?"\nДля приватных нажми GitHub ⚙":"\nПриватные — в пределах доступа токена"));});}catch(Exception e){String message=e.getMessage();final String info=message!=null&&message.contains("401")?"Токен недействителен. Открой GitHub ⚙":message!=null&&message.contains("403")?"GitHub ограничил доступ или число запросов. Проверь права токена или повтори позже.":"Не удалось обновить. Проверь интернет и подключение GitHub.";runOnUiThread(()->status.setText(info+"\nСохранённый список: "+prefs().getString("updated","пока отсутствует")));}finally{runOnUiThread(()->{busy=false;refresh.setEnabled(true);});}});}
 String projectThread(String name){try{JSONObject threads=new JSONObject(prefs().getString("project_threads","{}"));String url=threads.optString(name);if(UpdatePolicy.trustedThreadUrl(url))return url;}catch(Exception e){}return "my-projects".equals(name)?"https://chatgpt.com/local/6afbc15c-b5ac-8191-b689-765abe957078":"";}
 static final String RELEASES_URL="https://nicolenkoe.github.io/fragment-logo-editor/my-projects/releases.json";
 static final int INSTALL_PERMISSION=501;
 ExecutorService updateExecutor=Executors.newSingleThreadExecutor();boolean checkedUpdates=false,checkingUpdates=false,downloadingUpdate=false;long lastUpdateCheck=0;JSONObject pendingRelease;ProgressDialog downloadDialog;File verifiedUpdate;
 int installedCode()throws Exception{return getPackageManager().getPackageInfo(getPackageName(),0).versionCode;}
 void updateMessage(String text){if(!isFinishing()&&!isDestroyed()){status.setText(text);Toast.makeText(this,text,Toast.LENGTH_LONG).show();}}
 void checkUpdates(boolean manual){
  if(checkingUpdates||downloadingUpdate)return;checkingUpdates=true;final boolean includeTesting=prefs().getBoolean("testing_updates",false);if(manual)status.setText("Проверяю обновления приложения…");
  updateExecutor.execute(()->{try{
   HttpURLConnection c=(HttpURLConnection)new URL(RELEASES_URL+"?t="+System.currentTimeMillis()).openConnection();c.setConnectTimeout(12000);c.setReadTimeout(15000);c.setInstanceFollowRedirects(false);c.setRequestProperty("Cache-Control","no-cache");String json;
   try{if(c.getResponseCode()!=200)throw new IOException();try(InputStream in=c.getInputStream();ByteArrayOutputStream out=new ByteArrayOutputStream()){byte[] b=new byte[4096];int n;while((n=in.read(b))!=-1){out.write(b,0,n);if(out.size()>262144)throw new IOException();}json=out.toString("UTF-8");}}finally{c.disconnect();}
   JSONObject manifest=new JSONObject(json);if(manifest.optInt("schemaVersion")!=1||!getPackageName().equals(manifest.optString("packageName")))throw new IOException();JSONObject suppliedThreads=manifest.optJSONObject("projectThreads");if(suppliedThreads!=null){JSONObject clean=new JSONObject();java.util.Iterator<String> keys=suppliedThreads.keys();while(keys.hasNext()){String name=keys.next();String url=suppliedThreads.optString(name);if(UpdatePolicy.trustedThreadUrl(url))clean.put(name,url);}prefs().edit().putString("project_threads",clean.toString()).apply();runOnUiThread(()->{if(!isFinishing()&&!isDestroyed())render();});}JSONArray versions=manifest.getJSONArray("releases");int highest=installedCode();JSONObject best=null;
   for(int i=0;i<versions.length();i++){JSONObject r=versions.getJSONObject(i);int code=r.optInt("versionCode",-1);if(UpdatePolicy.eligible(highest,code,r.optString("channel"),includeTesting,r.optBoolean("withdrawn"))&&r.optInt("minSdk",26)<=Build.VERSION.SDK_INT&&UpdatePolicy.trustedUrl(r.optString("apkUrl"))&&UpdatePolicy.validHash(r.optString("sha256"))){best=r;highest=code;}}
   final JSONObject release=best;runOnUiThread(()->{if(isFinishing()||isDestroyed())return;if(release!=null){pendingRelease=release;showPendingUpdate();}else if(manual)updateMessage(includeTesting?"Новых версий нет":"Новых стабильных версий нет. Тестовые можно включить ниже.");});
  }catch(Exception e){if(manual)runOnUiThread(()->updateMessage("Не удалось проверить обновления. Попробуй позже."));}finally{runOnUiThread(()->checkingUpdates=false);}});
 }
 void showPendingUpdate(){if(pendingRelease==null||!hasWindowFocus()||isFinishing()||isDestroyed())return;final JSONObject release=pendingRelease;pendingRelease=null;String channel="testing".equals(release.optString("channel"))?"Тестовая версия":"Стабильная версия";new AlertDialog.Builder(this).setTitle("Доступно обновление "+release.optString("versionName")).setMessage(channel+"\n\n"+release.optString("notes")+"\n\nСкачать APK и открыть установку? Настройки сохранятся.").setPositiveButton("Обновить",(d,w)->downloadUpdate(release)).setNegativeButton("Позже",(d,w)->{}).show();}
